flowchart LR
    Gateway[Gateway auth middleware] -->|GET session:key| Redis[(Redis / ElastiCache)]
    Auth[Auth service] -->|SET / GET / DEL session:key; 7-day TTL| Redis
    Resume[Resume service] -->|GET / SET resume:user| Redis
    Roadmap[Roadmap service] -->|Cache roadmap data; 1-hour TTL; list invalidation| Redis
    Interview[Interview service] -->|Read / invalidate interview:user cache| Redis
    Resume --> Mongo[(MongoDB durable records)]
    Roadmap --> Mongo
    Interview --> Mongo
    Auth --> Mongo
